      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While there has recently been a lot of issues in vrchat for oculus users I believe your described issue sounds like you are running out of VRAM. Monitor your VRAM and system RAM while you play. There are temporary workarounds such as trying to switch worlds a couple of times or lowering your steamvr resolution scale, but if it is a VRAM issue you will eventually have to restart the game or your computer to get things back to normal.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
