      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have this issue for a few weeks too.\nOccurs after over an hour of game play, got a Index and i9 9900k and 2080ti, same utilisation of each, generally around 50% cpu and 80% gpu only using 16GB of ram, basically never going over 16GB in total that is not just VRChat using 16. I have noticed no increase in utilisation of say like VRAM or anything but when returning to game as mentioned on the post, I get awful FPS too and frame times, if I cant be bothered to restart (every hour basically) I'd have to turn my Super Sampling down slowly until it happens again and again and so on till I get to around 40% before I bother to restart.",
      "viewerReactions": null
